The CLI form must be refused: --ocannl_definitely_not_a_config_key=true
The environment form must be refused: OCANNL_DEFINITELY_NOT_A_CONFIG_KEY=true
The bare documentation form must be refused: `definitely_not_a_config_key=true`
The CLI documentation form must be refused: `--ocannl_definitely_not_a_config_key=true`
The environment documentation form must be refused: `OCANNL_DEFINITELY_NOT_A_CONFIG_KEY=true`
The uppercase dashed CLI form must be refused: `--OCANNL-DEFINITELY-NOT-A-CONFIG-KEY=true`
The one-dash CLI form must be refused: `-ocannl-definitely-not-a-config-key=true`
The empty-value documentation form must be refused: `definitely_not_a_config_key=`
The underscore value-separator form must be refused: `--ocannl_definitely_not_a_config_key_value`
The dash value-separator form must be refused: `--ocannl-definitely-not-a-config-key-value`
The no-value-separator form must be refused: `--ocannl_definitelynotaconfigkeyvalue`
The spaced documentation form must be refused: `definitely_not_a_config_key = true`
This larger identifier is not an OCANNL variable and must be ignored: MY_OCANNL_DEFINITELY_NOT_A_CONFIG_KEY=true
An environment assignment in a command span must be refused: `OCANNL_DEFINITELY_NOT_A_SECOND_CONFIG_KEY=true dune build`
A qualified CLI token in a command span must be refused: `dune build --ocannl-definitely-not-a-third-config-key=true`
Fenced prefixed tokens must be refused too:
```bash
OCANNL_DEFINITELY_NOT_A_FOURTH_CONFIG_KEY=true dune build
dune build --ocannl-definitely-not-a-fifth-config-key=true
```
